l pretty soon where I'll  talk about YouTube and give advice on it  as well so stay tuned for that but let's  talk about the rest of phase 4 it's  sounding like shang-chi is going to be  an absolutely incredible movie but from  everything I've heard so far it doesn't  sound like it's going to connect too  much with all of the other MCU films or  shows however something major that is  happening is we are going to have two  different Disney plus series and two  different MCU films connect to each  other in a major way each film or show  is going to severely affect what happens  in the films or shows to come the one  division series Doctor Strange and the  multiverse of madness the Loki series  and Thor love and thunder are all going  to connect to each other in a big way  the one division series is going to  truly introduce the Scarlet Witch this  has been confirmed they're going to call  her The Scarlet Witch for the very first  time in the MCU during the show we're  also going to really see her be an  actual witch of course she got her  powers from the mine stone but in the  series we're going to see her tap more  to her powers we've already seen leaked  photos that show the Salem witch trials  and that show a character that is widely  believed to be Agatha Harkness Agatha  Harkness and the comics is the one who  teaches her and trains her how to use  her magical powers and then it looks  like there's going to be a major villain  introduced in the Wanda vision series  that is going to tie in to Doctor  Strange in the multiverse of madness  this could be Doctor Doom doctor dooms  mother was a witch and dr. doom himself  goes on to eventually become one of the  most powerful sorcerers the world has  ever seen and it has been reported that  dr. doom is making his way into the MCU  soon being built up as the next big bad  villain and actually I forgot to mention  that in the Eternals tyrant is supposed  to be introduced as well and tyrant was  once upon a time a Herald 